1
00:00:00,049 --> 00:00:04,328
Kiamat 13 November ternyata
pernah dikira benar-benar terjadi!

2
00:00:04,328 --> 00:00:06,192
Hampir 200 tahun lalu,

3
00:00:06,192 --> 00:00:08,459
langit Amerika hujan bintang...

4
00:00:08,459 --> 00:00:10,226
puluhan ribu per jam!

5
00:00:10,226 --> 00:00:12,345
Banyak yang berlutut berdoa,

6
00:00:12,345 --> 00:00:14,063
yakin dunia kiamat.

7
00:00:14,063 --> 00:00:16,006
Ternyata itu debu komet,

8
00:00:16,006 --> 00:00:18,165
yang dilewati Bumi setiap November.

9
00:00:18,165 --> 00:00:20,834
Banyak butirnya cuma sebesar pasir...

10
00:00:20,834 --> 00:00:24,004
tapi melesat 71 kilometer per detik!

11
00:00:24,004 --> 00:00:25,378
Debu yang sama...

12
00:00:25,378 --> 00:00:27,007
melintas lagi minggu ini.

13
00:00:27,007 --> 00:00:27,664
Follow,

14
00:00:27,664 --> 00:00:29,970
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
